## 🚨 CRITICAL: Final Port Takeover

The new, clean version of SQAuto is currently **blocked from starting on Port 80** because your host-level **Apache service** is still running.

### How to Go Live:
To activate the new system on `sqauto.zeraynce.com`, please run this one-liner on your VM:

```bash
sudo systemctl stop apache2 && cd ~/Downloads/SQAuto/docker && docker compose up -d --force-recreate
```

Once you run this:
1.  **Hard Reload (Ctrl+Shift+R)** your browser at `sqauto.zeraynce.com`.
2.  Look for the **"SQAuto Industrial v2.1.0-STABLE"** label at the bottom.
3.  **Start a new restoration**: You will see the "Extracting Stream" bar move immediately, backed by the new industrial logging.

